  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "af7b0111-622b-4ecb-abb4-7cea47b22925"],
 " (InfraGeometry)",
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the named undirected substrates"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"860e5f8e-bd69-43fb-ad9a-49f332a5cce6"]
}, Open  ]],

